      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Everyone knows the menu angle was never adjusted to discourage users from lying down in vr. /s \nIn all seriousness while we’ve been waiting years for the new UI to come I’m pretty sure they are fixing this issue. It’s just obviously taking years for them to do so and in the meantime they have not bothered to adjust the menu angle. \nForcing the single handed mode for the menu would be useful too and a great accessibility option.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
