      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}:  Yeah you're right, I saw that last night. I guess my request is that when using two controllers you could still pin the main menu in place vs having it attached to your hand. But I'm probably gonna default to using one controller.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
